{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_01",
      "hash": "57c1120001ae0af3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想試試\\n自己的實力呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_02",
      "hash": "57c1130001ae0ca6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要和身為教練訓練家\\n的我對戰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub074_select_01",
      "hash": "013750f68b0487bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對戰"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub074_select_02",
      "hash": "013751f68b04896e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "算了"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_03",
      "hash": "57c1140001ae0e59",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub074_system_01",
      "hash": "2b3d4cd5a8dc3f60",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_04",
      "hash": "57c1150001ae100c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好！我上啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_05",
      "hash": "57c1160001ae11bf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不對戰嗎？\\n那就下次再比吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_06",
      "hash": "57c1170001ae1372",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "教練訓練家竟然\\n完全不是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的對手！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的強大實在太值得表揚了。\\n請收下這份禮物。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_07",
      "hash": "57c1180001ae1525",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "活力碎片能治療\\n傷藥無法治療的瀕死狀態。\\c\\n請在關鍵的時刻使用喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_01",
      "hash": "2d431a0b4b16c83c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好！\\n又是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳熟悉的教練訓練家哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_02",
      "hash": "2d431d0b4b16cd55",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "爬月見山之前，\\n要來鍛鍊一下嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_03",
      "hash": "2d431c0b4b16cba2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_04",
      "hash": "2d43170b4b16c323",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_05",
      "hash": "2d43160b4b16c170",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳已經鍛鍊夠了？\\n那我們下次再比吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_06",
      "hash": "2d43190b4b16c689",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這真是場不錯的對戰！\\n請收下這個當作謝禮吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_07",
      "hash": "2d43180b4b16c4d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器57\\n是「聚寶功」！\\c\\n用了這個招式後滿地都是錢，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以撿起錢來小賺一筆喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_01",
      "hash": "5afd2611adf275d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這一帶是約會勝地的說。\\c\\n而在這裡，我……\\n卻是個孤高的教練訓練家！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_02",
      "hash": "5afd2311adf270b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我可是很強的哦？\\n我來跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳對戰吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_03",
      "hash": "5afd2411adf2726b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_04",
      "hash": "5afd2911adf27aea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我會好好地\\n教導[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_05",
      "hash": "5afd2a11adf27c9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳改變主意，\\n我們再來對戰吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_06",
      "hash": "5afd2711adf27784",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈啊～很久沒這麼開心過了！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳能收下這個嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_07",
      "hash": "5afd2811adf27937",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器15\\n是「地球上投」！\\c\\n這個招式能為對手帶來的傷害，\\n跟使出招式的寶可夢等級相同！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_01",
      "hash": "a5a55dd9f6d0fec2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "11號道路……\\n兩個數字一樣的感覺真棒呢！\\c\\n而我～這個教練訓練家\\n也是一等一的棒喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_02",
      "hash": "a5a55cd9f6d0fd0f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要向身為\\n教練訓練家的我挑戰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_03",
      "hash": "a5a55bd9f6d0fb5c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 26]"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_04",
      "hash": "a5a55ad9f6d0f9a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好！我可是很嚴格的哦！\\n看招！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_05",
      "hash": "a5a559d9f6d0f7f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳居然不對戰～！\\n算了，我們下次再比吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_06",
      "hash": "a5a558d9f6d0f643",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很強嘛……！\\n我心情挺不錯的，就送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這個吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_07",
      "hash": "a5a557d9f6d0f490",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要用了[VAR POKNAME(0002)]的糖果，\\n就能使[VAR POKNAME(0002)]變得更～強！\\c\\n特定寶可夢的糖果似乎可以\\n透過捕捉多隻相同的寶可夢，\\r\\n或把相同的寶可夢傳送給博士來獲得喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_01",
      "hash": "fd5129e1934f8537",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "岩山隧道裡危險重重！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳先在這裡鍛鍊一下吧～"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_02",
      "hash": "fd512ae1934f86ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "需要我一步步\\n好好教導[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_03",
      "hash": "fd512be1934f889d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 33]"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_04",
      "hash": "fd5124e1934f7cb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好！就讓大姐姐來\\n指導一下年輕人吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_05",
      "hash": "fd5125e1934f7e6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真遺憾！\\n我會等[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_06",
      "hash": "fd5126e1934f801e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我反而從[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳身上學到東西了～\\n……這是學費，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳收下吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_07",
      "hash": "fd5127e1934f81d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器13是讓寶可夢\\n學會「劈瓦」的道具！\\c\\n這個招式連對手的\\n光牆和反射壁也能劈開呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_01",
      "hash": "295811e7f4b96120",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "抖抖……真想好好追問一下……\\n為什麼膽小的我\\c\\n會被派來負責寶可夢塔……"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_02",
      "hash": "295814e7f4b96639",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "抖抖……啊，對戰是嗎？\\n我可是很強的喔……"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_03",
      "hash": "295813e7f4b96486",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 40]"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_04",
      "hash": "295816e7f4b9699f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "抖抖……\\n我、我上啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_05",
      "hash": "295815e7f4b967ec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不想對戰？……\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳、[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要走啦……"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_06",
      "hash": "295818e7f4b96d05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我覺得好過一點了。\\n我把掉在那邊的東西送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_07",
      "hash": "295817e7f4b96b52",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能讓寶可夢變強的糖果……\\c\\n我也把它放進了糖果罐\\n好好地保管著呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_01",
      "hash": "d40e5df203c5a895",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "城市與城市之間的小路……\\c\\n呵呵，７號道路，\\n總覺得很不錯呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_02",
      "hash": "d40e5af203c5a37c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……嗨，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好。\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_03",
      "hash": "d40e5bf203c5a52f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 47]"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_04",
      "hash": "d40e58f203c5a016",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "來……\\n演奏一場名為對戰的合奏吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_05",
      "hash": "d40e59f203c5a1c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呵呵，我明白了。\\n現在還不是時候對吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_06",
      "hash": "d40e56f203c59cb0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳為我帶來一場這麼出色的對戰。\\n請收下我這份小小的心意。"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_07",
      "hash": "d40e57f203c59e63",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器12能\\n教會寶可夢「硬撐」！\\c\\n在陷入異常狀態時使出這個招式，\\n威力會是平常的２倍，\\r\\n是個十分勇敢的招式呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_01",
      "hash": "8c35963b66cf54f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘿！\\n我是教練訓練家！\\c\\n我是被派到\\n格鬥道場來出差的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_02",
      "hash": "8c35953b66cf5343",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我可是很強的哦！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要跟我對戰嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_03",
      "hash": "8c35943b66cf5190",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 54]"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_04",
      "hash": "8c359b3b66cf5d75",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "來！\\n讓我們認真地比一場吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_05",
      "hash": "8c359a3b66cf5bc2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看清實力差距\\n也是能力的一種！"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_06",
      "hash": "8c35993b66cf5a0f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真是場不錯的對戰！\\n我希望[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳能收下這個！"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_07",
      "hash": "8c35983b66cf585c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器23的內容\\n是「雷電拳」！\\c\\n用帶電的拳頭\\n打擊對手！打擊對手！"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_01",
      "hash": "37586245763794cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在這浪漫的橋上，\\c\\n一邊聞著海風的味道一邊訓練，\\n真是事半功倍啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_02",
      "hash": "375863457637967e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Let's coaching！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_03",
      "hash": "3758644576379831",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 61]"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_04",
      "hash": "37586545763799e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "來！讓我們來開始\\n寶可夢對戰吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_05",
      "hash": "3758664576379b97",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不對戰嗎？\\n真遺憾啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_06",
      "hash": "3758674576379d4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "多麼浪漫的一戰啊。\\n……這是我的一點謝意。"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_07",
      "hash": "3758684576379efd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器59是教會寶可夢\\n「食夢」的招式學習器哦。\\c\\n雖然這招只能對\\n陷入睡眠狀態的對手使用……\\r\\n可是效果絕佳呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_01",
      "hash": "709c062d51436e41",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "寶可夢大道令人心情平靜，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳說是吧……"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_02",
      "hash": "709c032d51436928",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆…………啊啊，抱歉。\\n我發呆了。\\c\\n我是教練訓練家。\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是想跟我對戰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_03",
      "hash": "709c042d51436adb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 68]"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_04",
      "hash": "709c092d5143735a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好～我要上囉～"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_05",
      "hash": "709c0a2d5143750d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不對戰啊？\\n我明白了！慢慢來吧～"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_06",
      "hash": "709c072d51436ff4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真是場愉快的對戰～\\n我想是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的話，應該能活用這個的～"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_07",
      "hash": "709c082d514371a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器58裡頭裝的\\n是「直衝鑽」！\\c\\n使用後容易命中要害，\\n是個不停轉轉轉的招式喔～"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_01",
      "hash": "6ef3ba2829d8ffec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這附近的訓練家\\n個個都很強！\\c\\n沒錯……他們全都是我\\n培育出來的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_02",
      "hash": "6ef3bd2829d90505",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想變強是嗎？\\n讓我來當[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的對手吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_03",
      "hash": "6ef3bc2829d90352",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 75]"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_04",
      "hash": "6ef3b72829d8fad3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我要上了！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_05",
      "hash": "6ef3b62829d8f920",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這樣啊……真遺憾啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_06",
      "hash": "6ef3b92829d8fe39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這個彷彿在熊熊燃燒著的\\n成長先兆……！\\c\\n我送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一個\\n最適合[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的招式學習器吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_07",
      "hash": "6ef3b82829d8fc86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要使用招式學習器31，\\n就能學會「火焰拳」。\\c\\n好運的話，說不定能\\n使對手陷入灼傷狀態呢……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_01",
      "hash": "9971b21ce07042a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喂！我說[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳啊！\\n該不會是要去紅蓮鎮之類的？"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_02",
      "hash": "9971b31ce0704456",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我正閒得發慌呢～\\n可以讓我稍微訓練[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_03",
      "hash": "9971b41ce0704609",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 82]"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_04",
      "hash": "9971b51ce07047bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我的寶可夢們～\\n拿出你們的真本事吧～"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_05",
      "hash": "9971b61ce070496f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咦～\\n我超級難過的說～"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_06",
      "hash": "9971b71ce0704b22",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳打得不錯嘛！\\n給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一個好東西！"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_07",
      "hash": "9971b81ce0704cd5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器35大概就是個\\n用來學會「冰凍拳」的道具啦～\\c\\n拿來對付龍屬性和草屬性的對手\\n真的是效果絕佳的說～"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_01",
      "hash": "6c24c6167df19d4e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨～嚇了一跳嗎！？\\c\\n就連這種地方\\n也是有教練訓練家的喔。\\c\\n是說，每天通勤來這裡的我\\n才是最嚇一跳的……"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_02",
      "hash": "6c24c5167df19b9b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這地方除了對戰之外\\n也沒什麼事情好幹。\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要對戰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_03",
      "hash": "6c24c4167df199e8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 89]"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_04",
      "hash": "6c24cb167df1a5cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "就～是～嘛！\\n不對戰要幹啥！\\r\\n好的好的！我要上囉～"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_05",
      "hash": "6c24ca167df1a41a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我待在這裡的\\n意義到底是……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_06",
      "hash": "6c24c9167df1a267",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "難得[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳來到這裡……\\c\\n我就把我珍藏的道具\\n送給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_07",
      "hash": "6c24c8167df1a0b4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "糖果罐裡面要是裝滿了糖果，\\n會令人很開心呢～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_01",
      "hash": "15befe0ee287e045",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在教練訓練家最不想\\n被派到的地方排行榜中……\\c\\n無人發電廠排名第２！"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_02",
      "hash": "15befb0ee287db2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不論是在哪裡，\\n我都會好好工作的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_03",
      "hash": "15befc0ee287dcdf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 96]"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_04",
      "hash": "15bef90ee287d7c6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "勞動的喜悅！\\n我上囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_05",
      "hash": "15befa0ee287d979",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀？\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳需要準備一下？"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_06",
      "hash": "15bef70ee287d460",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳覺得我幹得不錯的話，\\n那就最好不過了。\\r\\n另外，請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也收下這個吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_07",
      "hash": "15bef80ee287d613",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "神奇糖果真的\\n很神奇呢～"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_01",
      "hash": "40a9f203997bee10",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀呀！我還以為來了個混水摸魚的，\\n原來是個小孩訓練家啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_02",
      "hash": "40a9f503997bf329",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "怎麼樣？要和大姐姐我這個\\n教練訓練家玩嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_03",
      "hash": "40a9f403997bf176",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 103]"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_04",
      "hash": "40a9f703997bf68f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那麼，\\nLet's寶可夢對戰！"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_05",
      "hash": "40a9f603997bf4dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不玩了？"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_06",
      "hash": "40a9f903997bf9f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "和[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳對戰很愉快！\\c\\n大姐姐就送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一樣東西吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_07",
      "hash": "40a9f803997bf842",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器22\\n是「岩崩」！\\c\\n這招真的很厲害～\\n使用後會有大量岩石崩落，\\c\\n在雙打對戰時，\\n能一口氣攻擊對手２隻寶可夢呢～"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_01",
      "hash": "3d4ec9fe70a02867",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我渴求戰鬥……"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_02",
      "hash": "3d4ecafe70a02a1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳……\\n渴求戰鬥嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_03",
      "hash": "3d4ecbfe70a02bcd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 110]"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_04",
      "hash": "3d4ec4fe70a01fe8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "堂堂正正地……\\n一決勝負吧！！！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_05",
      "hash": "3d4ec5fe70a0219b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這樣啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_06",
      "hash": "3d4ec6fe70a0234e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "愉快至極……\\n請收下我的謝意。"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_07",
      "hash": "3d4ec7fe70a02501",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "下次有機會的話，\\n我希望能與[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳再戰。"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_01",
      "hash": "68393df327935cb2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇啊～！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢好可愛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_02",
      "hash": "68393cf327935aff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是教練訓練家～！\\n我們來對戰吧～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_03",
      "hash": "68393bf32793594c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 117]"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_04",
      "hash": "68393af327935799",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "興奮緊張！\\n壯闊開場！"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_05",
      "hash": "683939f3279355e6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咦～！真沒趣！\\c\\n下次一定要和我對戰哦！\\n一定哦～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_06",
      "hash": "683938f327935433",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊哈哈！真好玩～！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳收下這個吧～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_07",
      "hash": "683937f327935280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器39\\n是「逆鱗」哦～\\c\\n像我這種\\n總是笑嘻嘻的傢伙，\\r\\n生氣起來可是很可怕的呢～"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_01",
      "hash": "fb08b67051709a59",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨，冠軍！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要進入這個洞窟\\n是OK的！\\c\\n今後我會以教練訓練家的身份\\n擋在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳面前！"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_02",
      "hash": "fb08b37051709540",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好了嗎？\\n那就來對戰吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_03",
      "hash": "fb08b470517096f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 124]"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_04",
      "hash": "fb08b97051709f72",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我要上啦！冠軍！"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_05",
      "hash": "fb08ba705170a125",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳改變主意的話，\\n我們再來比吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_06",
      "hash": "fb08b77051709c0c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真是場精彩的對戰！\\n不愧是冠軍！\\c\\n我徹底輸了……\\n請收下這個吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_07",
      "hash": "fb08b87051709dbf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "聽說華藍洞窟裡\\n好像有隻可怕的寶可夢……\\c\\n不過，我只是個守衛，\\n其實也不太清楚就是了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_01",
      "hash": "cf6eca69f0638984",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我叫森本。\\c\\n我因為某些原因\\n在幫忙教練訓練家的工作～"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_02",
      "hash": "cf6ecd69f0638e9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要跟我這個\\n最強的教練訓練家對戰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_03",
      "hash": "cf6ecc69f0638cea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 131]"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_04",
      "hash": "cf6ec769f063846b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那我上囉～"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_05",
      "hash": "cf6ec669f06382b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不對戰啊？\\n那我們下次再比吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_06",
      "hash": "cf6ec969f06387d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很強呢～\\n給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這個吧～"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_07",
      "hash": "cf6ec869f063861e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要多捉\\n一些寶可夢，\\c\\n然後變得更加\\n喜歡寶可夢喔～"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_08",
      "hash": "57c1190001ae16d8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喔！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是個新手訓練家對吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_09",
      "hash": "57c11a0001ae188b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是教練訓練家的一員！\\c\\n我們的職責是在各個地方，\\n幫助訓練家培養他們的實力！"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_09not",
      "hash": "ea06bd27e78a6c2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 138]"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "id": "msg_sub074_system_02",
      "hash": "2b3d4fd5a8dc4479",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 139]"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_10",
      "hash": "57c4970001b122c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然有點自賣自誇，但我們這些\\n教練訓練家……可是很強的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_11",
      "hash": "57c4960001b12116",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想試試自己的實力，\\n請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一定要跟我們對戰啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "id": "msg_sub074_shop_01",
      "hash": "7af1cbb7bd0ad8bf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 142]"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "id": "msg_sub074_shop_system_01",
      "hash": "91c01030e481a3b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 143]"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "id": "msg_sub074_shop_02",
      "hash": "7af1ccb7bd0ada72",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 144]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_074_max",
      "hash": "be8ddc72f094db89"
    }
  ]
}
